data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":84,"item_id":"rs_09999309464786af016acba192b6f881948bc9448f8eba7d52","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Clarifying migration tests**\n\nI need to figure out the order for the migration tests for existing covered old tests. I’m not sure if there's a specific position after migration that needs to be documented. It seems fine, but it would be good to clarify that in the documentation. I think committing this will help keep track of everything, and I want to make sure I don’t miss anything important as I go through this process!"}

